:: MP Keepsake Use Whistle 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨雾迷蒙的雾角灯塔回音廊最深处，<<else>>海潮平缓的雾角灯塔回音廊外侧石台上，<</if>>你取出守塔人铜哨，对准石壁上新显露的三孔潮音石槽，旁边还立着一尊青铜测风标。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_foghorn_whistle"]>>铜哨尾端的双锚纹在海风里泛着温润光泽。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks4_whistle"]>><span class="teal">因为先前用鲸油润泽过哨尾螺纹，铜哨嵌入三孔石槽时严丝合缝。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs5_whistle is 1>>
回音廊的三孔潮音石槽今日已借铜哨共鸣完毕，海面风平浪静。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-5">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "嵌槽吹哨 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-5">>
<<if (($swimmingskill or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks4_whistle'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_whistle to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_whistle_rew")>><<money 440>>三道潮音叠合震开石槽暗格，吐出一卷早年灯塔长老留下的海事银币。<<else>>浑厚哨音顺着海面传出数里，引航浮标的铜铃遥相回应。<</if>><span class="green">守塔人铜哨唤醒了回音廊最深处的三孔潮音。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海浪拍岸声忽高忽低，吹哨时气息乱了半拍。<span class="red">你扶住石栏平复呼吸。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[矮身再嵌槽吹哨 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link "校准朝向 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-whistle-5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_whistle to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks5_whistle"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks5_whistle"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_whistle_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>顺风哨音精准撞开暗礁石匣，你取出了里面封存的远洋护航信物铜牌。<<else>>测风标叶片稳稳指向顺风位，哨音清越悠长。<</if>><span class="green">你借风向让守塔人铜哨发挥出极致威力。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
	测风标转轴沾着盐粒，拨动时略有些卡滞。<span class="red">你拂去轴边盐粒定下神。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[敛息再校准朝向 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Whistle 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:12)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Core 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>子夜的机括城停摆天文台主轴座前，<<else>>机括城停摆天文台安静的黄铜主轴座前，<</if>>你取出蓝钢怀表芯，将其贴近主轴侧面的双游丝耦合槽，台面旁放着一柄校音铜叉。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_clockwork_core"]>>蓝钢游丝在恒温空气中发出均匀清脆的搏动。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks4_core"]>><span class="teal">借着先前在差分机共振座同步过的振频，怀表芯一近耦合槽便产生了共鸣。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs5_core is 1>>
天文台主轴座的双游丝耦合槽今日已借怀表芯校准妥当。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-core-5">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "卡入表芯 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core-5">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks4_core'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_core to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_core_rew")>><<money 440>>双游丝同频共振，主轴底匣弹出一卷早年钟表大师封存的纪念银币。<<else>>主轴齿轮群随之轻快运转，整座天文台的指针重归精准。<</if>><span class="green">蓝钢怀表芯带动了天文台主轴耦合器。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	耦合槽边缘的防磁簧片略紧，卡入时偏了毫厘。<span class="red">你用鹿皮托稳表芯退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压手再卡入表芯 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link "敲响音叉 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-core-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_core to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks5_core"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks5_core"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_core_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>清越叉音与游丝合拍，侧面暗格滑开，奉上一叠机括城特等研发蓝钢母件。<<else>>铜叉余音与怀表芯滴答声浑然一体，令人心旷神怡。<</if>><span class="green">你凭声学振频彻底参透了蓝钢怀表芯的玄机。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
	远处蒸汽管传来一声闷响，盖过了铜叉的尾音。<span class="red">你按住铜叉等杂音散去。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沉肩再敲响音叉 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Core 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Ring 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声淅沥的沉没修道院告解回音壁内侧，<<else>>烛影幽静的沉没修道院告解回音壁内侧，<</if>>你取出银鸽指环，对准檀木格栅下方那枚凹陷的双翼封蜡座，旁边搁着一碟净水与白麻布。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_abbey_ring"]>>指环上的银鸽浮雕在烛光下栩栩如生。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks4_ring"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前在密龛圣爵印槽拓下的合印角度，你一眼认出了双翼封蜡座的旋向。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs5_ring is 1>>
告解回音壁的双翼封蜡座今日已借银鸽指环开启过，檀香幽远。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-5">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "按入指环 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-5">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks4_ring'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_ring to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_ring_rew")>><<money 440>>封蜡座下沉半寸，格栅暗屉滑出，露出一叠古修道院秘藏的奉纳银券。<<else>>回音壁内传来柔和的低鸣，檀木格栅后的暗室豁然开朗。<</if>><span class="green">银鸽指环完美开启了告解回音壁的秘龛。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回修道院 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	封蜡座边缘积着一层陈年香灰，按入时滑了一下。<span class="red">你拂去香灰稳住指尖。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[俯身再按入指环 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回修道院 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpeavesdropicon>><<link "拭亮戒面 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-ring-5">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_ring to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks5_ring"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks5_ring"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<historyskill 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_ring_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>洁净戒面与内簧严丝合缝，暗格底层弹出一袋早年教团长老留下的古修会纪念章。<<else>>银鸽指环被净水拭得纤尘不染，佩戴在指间温润安心。<</if>><span class="green">你以虔敬洁净的礼法唤醒了银鸽指环的暗锁。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
	净水微凉，白麻布擦拭时勾住了戒托边角。<span class="red">你轻轻解开麻布丝线。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凝神再拭亮戒面 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Ring 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回修道院 (0:08)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Amber 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜色柔和的秘密温室玻璃穹顶露台上，<<else>>天光澄明的秘密温室玻璃穹顶露台上，<</if>>你取出琥珀香膏瓶，放在聚光水晶台中央的六角铜座上，旁边摆着一只盛满山泉的银喷壶。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_glasshouse_amber"]>>琥珀内的初代银脉兰正散发着幽幽翠光。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks4_amber"]>><span class="teal">借着先前在育种钟罩里熏出的琥珀香雾，六角铜座下的感光簧片已悄然松动。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs5_amber is 1>>
穹顶露台的聚光水晶台今日已借琥珀香膏瓶映射完毕，花香沁人。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Amber 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-5">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "对准光台 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-5">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks4_amber'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_amber to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_amber_rew")>><<money 440>>翠绿光束折射入底座，弹出一只装着植物学会特等悬赏金的丝绒袋。<<else>>琥珀微光投映在玻璃穹顶上，整座露台宛如梦境般璀璨。<</if>><span class="green">琥珀香膏瓶在聚光台上绽放出绚丽光华。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回温室 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	露台玻璃顶掠过一片浮云，聚光光束微微偏了半寸。<span class="red">你等云影散开定下心神。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[蹲身再对准光台 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Amber 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回温室 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpastroicon>><<link "喷出薄雾 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-amber-5">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_amber to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks5_amber"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks5_amber"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<historyskill 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_amber_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>水雾将琥珀荧光化作七彩光环，台座侧门滑开，奉上一叠名流名流认养花签。<<else>>细密水珠衬得琥珀晶莹剔透，四周的名贵兰花纷纷舒展叶片。<</if>><span class="green">你借水雾折光法解开了聚光台的隐藏暗格。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
	银喷壶气压略足，喷出的水雾稍密遮住了底座刻度。<span class="red">你拿干绒布拭去多余水珠。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺势再喷出薄雾 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Amber 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回温室 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Medal 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>风雨交加的黑铁货运站三号装甲货车旁，<<else>>寒气渐重的黑铁货运站三号装甲货车旁，<</if>>你取出站长纪念铜章，对准车厢底盘侧面那只带齿轮凹槽的密封阀箱，箱旁挂着一把重型铜扳手。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_blackiron_medal"]>>铜章上的蒸汽机车浮雕棱角分明。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks4_medal"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前在信号塔联锁盘前验过的印槽规格，你将站长纪念铜章稳稳扣入了阀箱母槽。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs5_medal is 1>>
三号装甲货车的密封阀箱今日已借站长纪念铜章开启过，锁扣严实。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-5">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "压入铜章 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-5">>
<<if (($physique or 10000) + ($mpClues['clue_ks4_medal'] ? 600 : 0)) gte 11500 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_medal to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_medal_rew")>><<money 440>>阀箱锁舌应声退回，里面码放着一匣铁路工会早年封存的互助银币。<<else>>阀箱内的气压表指针平稳归零，装甲车底舱暗格一览无余。<</if>><span class="green">你借站长纪念铜章打开了装甲货车底盘阀箱。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
	底盘阀箱沾着厚重煤灰，铜章压入时滑脱了半寸。<span class="red">你拍去手心煤灰退后半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦手再压入铜章 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<spaicon "massage">><<link "扳动联锁 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-medal-5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_medal to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks5_medal"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks5_medal"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_medal_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>铜章与扳手双力合一，底舱副金库弹开，你取出了里面的押运头等调度铜牌。<<else>>联锁齿轮顺滑咬合，整套开启过程未发出半点金属撞击声。<</if>><span class="green">你用联动手法彻底开启了装甲车副金库。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
	重型铜扳手手柄冰凉湿滑，发力时震麻了虎口。<span class="red">你握紧扳手缓了一口气。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[屏息再扳动联锁 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Medal 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Antler 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>月华如水的深林古石环守林人瞭望台下，<<else>>林风清冽的深林古石环守林人瞭望台下，<</if>>你取出白鹿角坠饰，对准古树干上那道形如鹿角的天然木瘤凹槽，旁边悬着一串青铜风铃。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_druid_antler"]>>温润的白鹿角在林间泛着柔和象牙光。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks4_antler"]>><span class="teal">顺着先前在迷雾石柱群试出的鹿角共鸣方位，你一眼认出了树干木瘤凹槽的暗栓。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs5_antler is 1>>
瞭望台古树干的木瘤暗槽今日已借白鹿角坠饰开启过，林风悠然。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-5">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "贴合木瘤 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-5">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks4_antler'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_antler to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_antler_rew")>><<money 440>>树干暗格悄然弹开，露出一只装满守林人世代留存古银币的桦皮匣。<<else>>鹿角分叉与木瘤纹理严丝合缝，头顶林冠传来温顺的鸟鸣。<</if>><span class="green">白鹿角坠饰唤醒了瞭望台古树的藏宝暗格。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回古石环 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木瘤槽边缘覆着一层滑腻松脂，贴合时滑开了半寸。<span class="red">你用干叶拭净松脂退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓步再贴合木瘤 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回古石环 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link "拨响风铃 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-antler-5">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 440 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_antler to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks5_antler"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks5_antler"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<historyskill 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_antler_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span>清越铃音与鹿角共振，树根下的石匣滑开，奉上一袋珍贵的巡山护林骨牌。<<else>>铃声在石环间久久回荡，林间白雾自动为你让开一条清朗归路。<</if>><span class="green">风铃与白鹿角的共鸣令整片古林为你赐福。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
	山风忽急吹乱了风铃节奏，共鸣音散在了林涛里。<span class="red">你伸手稳住风铃铜舌。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[贴近再拨响风铃 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Antler 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回古石环 (0:12)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Mask 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>华灯初上的天鹅绒暗层观海露台内廊里，<<else>>丝绒帷幔低垂的天鹅绒暗层观海露台内廊，<</if>>你取出纯银狐面胸针，对准雕花壁炉架中央那枚狐首暗扣，架旁摆着一盏紫晶香薰炉。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_velvet_mask"]>>银狐眼窝里的红宝石在烛光下熠熠生辉。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks4_mask"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前在试衣沙龙铜镜前调准的折射角度，你一眼看出了壁炉架狐首扣的针孔。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs5_mask is 1>>
观海露台内廊的壁炉架狐首暗扣今日已借胸针开启过，香雾缭绕。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-5">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "扣入胸针 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-5">>
<<if (($seductionskill or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks4_mask'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_mask to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_mask_rew")>><<money 460>>壁炉侧板无声滑开，你将里面封存的贵宾包厢不记名金票收入怀中。<<else>>双狐合璧严丝合缝，壁炉暗格里的珍藏名录尽收眼底。<</if>><span class="green">你用纯银狐面胸针打开了露台壁炉秘格。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回暗层 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	壁炉架余温尚存，扣入银针时指尖被铜边烘得微热。<span class="red">你收回手指轻轻吹了吹。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扶墙再扣入胸针 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回暗层 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsmokeicon>><<link "借烟映锁 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-mask-5">>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 250 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_mask to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks5_mask"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks5_mask"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<skulduggery 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_mask_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>红宝石透过香雾投出暗码，底座小屉弹出，露出一匣高额沙龙沙龙贵宾银筹。<<else>>轻盈香雾衬得银狐胸针愈发神秘优雅，举手投足尽显从容。<</if>><span class="green">你借香雾折光彻底激发了银狐胸针的妙用。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
	露台海风吹散了香薰烟缕，红宝石光斑晃动难辨。<span class="red">你合拢半扇百叶窗挡风。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫布再借烟映锁 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Mask 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回暗层 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Use Lens 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>星辉倾泻的旧天文翼楼屋顶钟楼连廊上，<<else>>光线通透的旧天文翼楼屋顶钟楼连廊上，<</if>>你取出消色差古透镜，对准连廊石栏正中的古黄道浑天环，环旁放着一把象牙微调尺。<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_observatory_lens"]>>消色差镜片在光下泛着幽蓝镀膜光泽。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_ks4_lens"]>><span class="teal">借着先前在标本暗阁调准的检偏筒焦距，古透镜一旋便卡进了浑天环的观测座。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpKs5_lens is 1>>
屋顶连廊的古黄道浑天环今日已借古透镜校准完毕，视野极佳。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-5">
<<keepsakeicon>><<link "旋入环座 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-5">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_ks4_lens'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_lens to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_lens_rew")>><<money 460>>浑天环三圈同步归位，石栏暗匣弹出一卷早年皇家天文学会拨发的奖金。<<else>>透过消色差透镜望去，整座小镇与远海灯塔的坐标纤毫毕现。<</if>><span class="green">消色差古透镜完美解开了古浑天环的观测锁。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	高处连廊风大，旋入透镜时铜螺纹卡在了半圈处。<span class="red">你双手护住镜筒退后半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[缓气再旋入环座 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpastroicon>><<link "量定视差 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-keepsake-use-lens-5">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpKs5_lens to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["clue_ks5_lens"]>><<set $mpClues["clue_ks5_lens"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<historyskill 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("ks5_lens_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>视差归零瞬间，底座石龛滑开，露出一盒历代院长私藏的学会纪念星盘。<<else>>微调尺刻度与透镜十字丝严丝合缝，观测精度达到了极致。<</if>><span class="green">你凭视差测量法彻底发挥了古透镜的价值。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	
<<else>>
	象牙微调尺表面光滑，冷风吹得指尖微僵差点拿不稳。<span class="red">你把微调尺握在掌心暖热。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[凝目再量定视差 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Use Lens 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

